{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/4a2ee9b6a5084ff4f9615ede78a1006a.poster.avif?t=1754310134\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/4a2ee9b6a5084ff4f9615ede78a1006a.webm?t=1754310134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/4a2ee9b6a5084ff4f9615ede78a1006a.mp4?t=1754310134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cake UP, you will play as a cake courier who delivers an order to the king, in the midst of a magical war. He finds himself on a fierce battlefield of two magicians who do not pay attention to a small courier. The poor guy is trying to get around obstacles and bandits, and he's also worried about the safety of the cake, otherwise the customer will be furious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player tries on the role of a courier who wants to do his job during the battle of two magicians.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver the order to the final destination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge the spells that threaten you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various types of spells flying around the arena, which you will have to deftly avoid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped a piece of cake? Get up off the ground! No one has canceled the five-second rule!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the cupcakes scattered on each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge all the spells and collect all the cupcakes to get the highest score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock levels as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight unique bosses at the end of each location</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/dd619810a9ce024ee285725a740384c8.avif?t=1754310134\" width=1600 height=450 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557380?t=1754310134","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/aef7d2d18b0a7efea90428f9d45913e996961b10/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754310134","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/a20a1b1af2ad01f1ed500336059abe535b967db5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754310134","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/a20a1b1af2ad01f1ed500336059abe535b967db5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754310134","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/4a2ee9b6a5084ff4f9615ede78a1006a.poster.avif?t=1754310134\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/4a2ee9b6a5084ff4f9615ede78a1006a.webm?t=1754310134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/4a2ee9b6a5084ff4f9615ede78a1006a.mp4?t=1754310134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cake UP, you will play as a cake courier who delivers an order to the king, in the midst of a magical war. He finds himself on a fierce battlefield of two magicians who do not pay attention to a small courier. The poor guy is trying to get around obstacles and bandits, and he's also worried about the safety of the cake, otherwise the customer will be furious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player tries on the role of a courier who wants to do his job during the battle of two magicians.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver the order to the final destination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge the spells that threaten you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various types of spells flying around the arena, which you will have to deftly avoid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped a piece of cake? Get up off the ground! No one has canceled the five-second rule!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the cupcakes scattered on each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge all the spells and collect all the cupcakes to get the highest score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock levels as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight unique bosses at the end of each location</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/dd619810a9ce024ee285725a740384c8.avif?t=1754310134\" width=1600 height=450 /></span></p>","developers":["Cryolite Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/455fee93cfc7644382413385621ab6d4251aca91/header.jpg?t=1754310134","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3557380/348252470/7bf87bb4c59c45c349f27d8a25981728dc2414a0/1750840372/dash